+
+// The GPT partition that carries the root image. Upstream sheng compiled in "userdata" because
+// there the root image was flashed over the whole userdata partition. TB710FU can keep Android's
+// userdata and place the root image in a separate partition, so the name is a runtime value.
+// NativeUfs.cpp defines it (default "userdata") and sets it from the tb710fu-root-partition boot
+// argument; host tests define it explicitly. The terminator check below keeps a short name from
+// matching a longer partition that merely starts with it.
+extern const char *gRootPartitionName;
+
